sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant F as Frontend (React + Vite)
    participant P as Vite Proxy (Port 5173)
    participant B as Backend API (Express on Port 5000)
    participant DB as Database (PostgreSQL via Prisma)
    
    U->>F: Enters credentials & clicks Login
    F->>P: POST /api/auth/login
    P->>B: Routes request to Express backend
    B->>DB: Prisma query: findUnique(email)
    DB-->>B: Returns user record + hashed password
    B->>B: Bcrypt validates password match
    B-->>F: Returns 200 OK + JWT Token
    F->>U: React Router updates view to Dashboard
    
    note over U,DB: Standard Data Fetching Flow
    
    loop Fetching Dashboard Data
        F->>P: GET /api/data (with Bearer JWT)
        P->>B: Routes request
        B->>B: JWT Middleware acts as gatekeeper
        B->>DB: Prisma fetches requested records
        DB-->>B: Returns SQL rows
        B-->>F: Returns formatted JSON response
        F->>U: Renders Tailwind UI components
    end
